base_view: dbt_analytics_prod__mart_team_xg
label: Team xG & Shot Metrics
description: Season-level team analytics — calibrated xG for/against, Corsi, Fenwick, PDO.

ai_context: |
  One row per team-season. xg_for/xg_against are calibrated to season scoring environments.
  xg_share above 0.5 means the team out-chanced opponents. PDO near 1.000 is league average;
  well above suggests unsustainable shooting/save luck. Joined shot metrics view has corsi_pct/fenwick_pct.

